## Data Sources

PyBondLab is designed to work with corporate bond data from:

- **WRDS Enhanced TRACE**: Trade-based bond returns and characteristics
- **Open Source Bond Asset Pricing (OSBAP)**: Cleaned monthly bond panel
  - Download: https://openbondassetpricing.com/
  - Pre-processed with MMN corrections

The package includes WRDS breakpoint data for reproducible portfolio formation.

